/ActualText (When I started trading six years ago\054 I was lost\056 There was a ton of information around the web on modern investing\203 but much of it was contradictory\056 For instance\054 you\220ll learn how to use a powerful yet often misunderstood trading strategy in Chapter 26\056 When first experimenting with this tool\054 I accidently sold a major holding when the strategy was telling me to buy based on a false article claiming the pattern was bad for the company\054 missing a fortune\056)
/MCID 1
