/ActualText (The three main types of assets are real estate\054 paper assets\054 and alternative investments or businesses\056 I focus on paper assets for long\055term growth because real estate investing \050buying\054 renovating\054 selling\054 renting houses\054 etc\056\051 is a very different approach to wealth management\056 Many real estate investments beat the average stock market return\054 but these investments usually require much more time\054 attention\054 management\054 maintenance\054 and operational skills that are completely unneeded in the stock market\056)
/MCID 2
