/ActualText (The amount of money most people invest in the market usually depends on their income\056 Now\054 I am not here to tell you how to budget your life\054 which coffee shop to skip in the morning\054 or how much money you should give away every year\056 Additionally\054 I do not know how you can make yourself more money by working either for yourself or someone else\056 The responsibility of budgeting and increasing your income rests on your shoulders\056 You can make as much money through investments as you want\054 and it is up to you to put away the amount of money you want to meet your retirement goals\054 the maximum amount of money you can physically invest in America\054 or a mix between the two\056)
