/ActualText (Same as IRA\054 but you pay taxes on your earned income before you invest it\056 You pay no taxes once you sell your positions in retirement\056 Essentially\054 your money grows and your profits are never taxed\056 You can effectively contribute more to a Roth IRA because after\055tax dollars are worth more than pre\055tax dollars\056 These accounts are ideal for young adults in low tax brackets or anyone else with post\055tax cash\054 and they are the only individual trading account you can open)
