/ActualText (College\055savings plans help you pay for higher education by using tax\055advantaged asset growth to compound your college fund over time\056 For students and parents alike\054 the five main tax\055abated college\055savings plans to remember are UGMA accounts\054 UTMA accounts\054 529 College Savings Plans\054 529 Prepaid Tuition Plans\054 and Coverdell Education Savings Accounts\056)
/MCID 1
