/ActualText (Yahoo Finance is great for researching stocks because they give you all the tools you need to analyze any stock for any type of trading for free through the online Yahoo Finance website and mobile Yahoo Finance application\056 However\054 you cannot enter and exit positions directly through Yahoo Finance unless you link a real brokerage account to your Yahoo Finance account \050we will talk more about brokerages in Chapter 37\051\056\271 For the rest of this book\054 we will use Yahoo Finance to develop our stock trading skills\056)
