/ActualText (You can see market conditions just by looking at charts\056 Long run\055ups are called bull markets\056 In a bull market\054 you can expect to see more stocks go up than down as the whole market collectively increases in value\056 In our snippet of the S\046P\054 we can see bull market conditions from 2010 to 2015 and mid\0552016 to 2018\056)
/MCID 3
>> BDC
BT
/F2 11.04 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.024 267.17 Tm
