/ActualText (Remember that a stock is priced at what other people think it is worth\056\271 If masses of people want to buy a stock because they get a new patent\054 its price will increase because sellers in the market book get filled\056 If you see a huge price movement in the market\054 you can usually expect news behind it\056\271 You can use Yahoo Finance to see news about a stock right under its quote\056\262 A lot of trading platforms also have some sort of news feed for stocks\054 and Google always comes in handy as a last resort\056 Quickly glancing over news can help you figure out whether or not a significant price movement is justified\056)
/MCID 1
