/ActualText (When you look at index funds\054 see if they are weighted or unweighted\056 All of the aforementioned indices are weighted\054 which means that some stocks carry a larger percentage of the index\220s overall balance than others\056\262 In an unweighted index fund\054 all stocks represent the same percentage of the overall index\056\263 Differently\055weighted stocks allow index funds to more accurately represent the market by giving more value to higher market\055cap stocks\056 Market\055cap weighting is the most popular type of fund weighting because it emphasizes the value of larger\054 more valuable\054 and generally more established companies\056\263)
