/ActualText (Many investors successfully grow their retirements with index\055fund ETFs alongside sector\055specific ETFs in fields that they know a lot about\056 Alternatively\054 you may elect to purchase the best\055performing ETFs you can find\056 Whenever you invest into something for the long\055term that you know little about\054 be extra careful not to make overly\055emotional decisions in large market swings\056 Conversely\054 many investors feel fine holding their personal\054 researched long\055term picks through downturns because they see the value in a company or sector\220s long\055term business or value propositions \050perhaps based on technical analysis\051\056 It is always fine to invest based on facts and figures)
