/ActualText (Options give you the right but not the obligation to buy or sell an underlying security\056 You pay an \215option premium\216 for the right to trade an asset at a previously agreed upon price by a specified date\056\271 You can use options to hedge against risk when you own an underlying position or trade calls and puts independently for potential profits\056 Calls and puts simply stand as buy or sell options traded similarly to futures contracts\056)
/MCID 1
