/ActualText (Now that you understand supports and resistances\054 let\220s dive into diagonal trendlines\056 In an upward trend\054 buyers are willing to pay more for a stock while sellers stop selling for less\056 In a downward trend\054 buyers are willing to pay less for a stock while sellers start selling for less\056 These trends reflect immediate buying pressure and public prospects for future growth in long\055term positions\056)
