/ActualText (By connecting subsequent lows early on in this trend\054 we can use trendlines to predict the best times to buy\056 \044SHOP\220s price hit our quadruple\055bottom trendline in October 2017 alongside large red volume candles\054 screaming \215buy\056\216 As time increases\054 the price continued to hit the trendline for a little bit\056 Notice that the trendline lows increase over time while the highs get higher and higher\056 The upper trendline in this example can predict a good time to sell in the future\054 whereas the supporting trendline is currently being tested\056 If a stock falls out of a trend\054 adjust your trendlines accordingly\056)
