/P <<
/ActualText (During the initial run\055up\054 the stock forms the first shoulder before pulling back to a resistance line\056 Then\054 the stock shoots back up to form a new high and the head in the pattern\056 Afterwards\054 prices fall to the support line from the first shoulder and start to trace back up\056 This is the first moment when the head\055and\055shoulders pattern starts taking shape\054 as you can see by the underlying support alongside the first shoulder and the head\056 At this point\054 you want to see the stock bounce off the resistance created by the first shoulder as shown below\072)
/MCID 3
