/ActualText (Extreme candlesticks serve as terrific reversal indicators when they form a \215hammer\056\216 Hammers can help you find bottoms and tops in short\055term movements\056 You will see these candlesticks when a stock drops to test new lows but quickly recovers before a candle closes\054 leaving a large lower wick and small candle body\056\271 Meanwhile\054 the top wick in a hammer setup is very small or completely engulfed in the candlestick\054 as shown below\072)
