/ActualText (RSI\054 stochastics\054 and Bollinger Bands all help you identify extreme price movements in stock price\056 With this information\054 you can enter a trade at its most extreme downswings and exit towards the top with a technical background and basis behind your positions\056 These indicators help increase your trading consistency\054 especially while swing trading\054 by allowing you to easily play off trending or sideways environments with identifiable minimum and maximum prices\056)
