/ActualText (Although the two look similar on your chart\054 VWAP often predicts future intraday price movements more precisely than standalone short\055term nine\054 twenty\054 or fifty moving averages because the VWAP accounts for the intraday volume a stock trades at as a significant factor in its average price\056\271 Compared to moving averages which blindly assign the same value to each individual period\054 VWAP gives realistic price calculates by looking at the number of shares exchanged at any given intraday price level\054 dynamically adapting to market supply and demand\056\271 Notwithstanding\054 moving averages and VWAP still work tremendously together as a means of identifying significant psychological price levels in nine\055to\055noon trades\056)
