/ActualText (Funds stand out as one great exception to the five to seven percent rule\056 Since ETFs and mutual funds already invest in a wide range of assets\054 all you have to do is consider how they balance their investments\056 Does the fund simply follow an index\054 diversifying it across the entire market\077 Perhaps it focuses on a specific sector\056 Does the fund invest in high\055yield corporate bonds or Treasury bills\077 Perhaps they dabble in foreign equity assets through individual investments or market\055tracking indices\056 Nonetheless\054 these funds)
