/ActualText (This book was written in an age of centralized brokers\054 clearinghouses\054 rebates\054 regulations\054 and more\056 I see many issues with current centralized asset markets and plan to invest my life decentralizing asset management to allow everyone to easily invest\054 open active trading to the world\054 and empower independent money managers \050like yourself\054 perhaps\051 rather than bean\055counting advisors so that anyone can build real savings and retirements\056)
/MCID 1
