/ActualText (If the nine\055to\055noon workday does not work for you\054 fear not\056 Long\055term investing\054 no matter who makes your portfolios\054 can help everyone\056 Grow your wealth in the stock market through the compounding strategies and diversified funds mentioned in this book\056 If you find the time\054 try to outperform the market with some stock picks\056 You do not have to work nine\055to\055noon to analyze and trade five medium\055term to long\055term stocks a week\056 By doing your own research\054 checking news periodically\054 and acting independently from the herd\054 you put yourself at a large financial advantage over those who ignore their investment future\056)
