/ActualText (The story behind this book began in my bedroom\054 where I sat down after six months of constant labor to finally bring my first major company to fruition\056 MonerAds creates revenue for online publishers through blockchain technologies and user computing contributions\056 Based on the Monero network\054 the company aims to change the face of online marketing by providing a real\054 profitable alternative to advertising\056 Only time will tell if much comes out of this project which has proudly brought work to many of my peers\056 As I fell into my bed\054 I asked myself\054 \042What next\077\042 I recalled the past three years of High School\054 internally manifesting my interests and passions\054 wondering for a brief moment about my future\056 That was the day I started writing this book\056 Just before my last year of high school\054 I set my writing deadline\072 Christmas Eve\056)
/MCID 1
