/ActualText (I greatly thank the developers and publishers at Yahoo Finance\054 ChartIQ\054 and TradingView for contributing to all asset investors by publishing market information\054 news\054 and stock analyses that influence sprouting individuals around the world and sit at the backbone of this book\056 Many thanks go to Google for unifying all of these sites and more through its search engine\056 Without this ability to connect individuals with information\054 I doubt I would have bought my first stock so long ago\056 Additionally\054 this manuscript was written in the ever\055useful Google Docs\056 Thank you Ross Cameron and the Investors Underground team for the immeasurably influential investing content\054 educational videos\054 and market success overviews I found as an inspiration to start exploring capital markets many years ago\056 This book would not be possible without the innovative business practices of CreateSpace\054 which was later acquired by Amazon and incorporated into Kindle Direct Publishing\056 I greatly thank the print\055on\055demand engineers\054 software developers\054 logistics professionals\054 and fulfillment specialists who made this book a reality\056)
/MCID 2
