/ActualText (31 \215Pre\055Webinar Profit Trifecta\056\216 Warrior Trading\054 Warrior Trading\054 Inc\054 www\056warriortrading\056com\057pre\055webinar\055profit\055trifecta\056 32 \215Warrior Trading Profit Trifecta\056\216 Warrior Trading\054 Warrior Trading\054 Inc\054 www\056warriortrading\056com\057profit\055trifecta\056 33 \215Have You Ever Met a Successful Day Trader\077\216 r\057Investing\054 Reddit\054 Inc\056\054 www\056reddit\056com\057r\057investing\057comments\057480qjf\057have\137you\137ever\137met\137a\137successful\137day\137trader\056 34 U\056S\056 stock market returns are represented by the Standard \046 Poor\220s 90 from 1926 through March 3\054 1957\073 the Standard \046 Poor\220s 500 Index from March 4\054 1957\054 through 1974\073 the Wilshire 5000 Index from 1975 through April 22\054 2005\073 the MSCI US Broad Market Index from April 23\054 2005\054 through June 2\054 2013\073 and the CRSP US Total Market Index thereafter\056 U\056S\056 bond market returns are represented by the Standard \046 Poor\220s High Grade Corporate Index from 1926 to 1968\054 the Citigroup High Grade Index from 1969 to 1972\054 the Lehman Brothers U\056S\056 Long Credit AA Index from 1973 to 1975\054 the Barclays Capital U\056S\056 Aggregate Bond Index from 1976 to 2009\054 and the Spliced Barclays U\056S\056 Aggregate Float Adjusted Bond Index thereafter\056 Vanguard calculations based on data from Standard \046 Poor\220s\054 Wilshire\054 MSCI\054 CRSP\054 Citigroup\054 and Barclays\056 35 Domestic stocks represented by S\046P 500 1926 \205 1986\054 Dow Jones U\056S\056 Total Market 1987\205 most recent year end\073 foreign stock represented by S\046P 500 1926 \205 1969\054 MSCI EAFE 1970 \205 2000\054 MSCI ACWI Ex USA 2001 \205 most recent year end\073 bonds represented by U\056S\056 intermediate\055term bonds 1926 \205 1975\054 Barclays U\056S\056 Aggregate Bond 1976 \205 most recent year end\073 short term represented by 30\055day U\056S\056 Treasury bills 1926 \205 most recent year end\056)
